---
// Variant 2, "Show the method". Axis: interaction model. No tabs: the whole note-to-requirement flow is on screen at once, left to right.
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import headshot from '../../assets/david-salazar-headshot.jpg';
---

<section class="hv hv-method">
  <div class="col">
    <div class="who hv-who">
      <Image src={headshot} alt="" width={48} height={48} densities={[1, 2]} loading="eager" />
      <p>
        <strong>David Salazar</strong>
        New York · open to business analyst, implementation and automation roles
      </p>
    </div>
    <h1>Clear requirements from messy problems.</h1>
    <p class="hv-lead">
      Here is how I take one line from a user and turn it into something a team can build and test,
      using my workout app Tetsu.
    </p>

    <ol class="hv-flow">
      <li class="hv-step">
        <span class="hv-step-label">A note</span>
        <p>
          “My whole routine lives in my notes app: bench 135&nbsp;lb for 8, dumbbell curls 27.5&nbsp;lb
          for 12. Every tracker makes me retype it, and I’m afraid I’ll lose my numbers.”
        </p>
        <small>A working persona, not an interview.</small>
      </li>
      <li class="hv-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
      </li>
      <li class="hv-step">
        <span class="hv-step-label">A user story</span>
        <p>
          As a lifter who keeps my routine in a notes app, I want to paste it in and check how it
          was read before anything is saved, so that I keep my numbers exactly as written.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="hv-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
      </li>
      <li class="hv-step">
        <span class="hv-step-label">Acceptance criteria</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Given pasted text with decimal weights like 27.5&nbsp;lb, when it is imported, then every value is kept exactly as written.</li>
          <li>Given an import, when the review screen shows, then nothing replaces the current plan until I confirm.</li>
          <li>Given a backup restore, when a day already has data, then that day is not overwritten.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/work/tetsu/">Read the Tetsu case study</a>
      <a class="btn soft" href="/David_Salazar_Resume.pdf">Resume (PDF)</a>
      <a class="textlink" href="mailto:davesal0710@gmail.com">Email me</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .hv-method {
    padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 5vh, 3.5rem) 3rem;
  }
  .hv-method h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.2rem + 2.6vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    max-width: 14em;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.9rem;
  }
  .hv-method .hv-lead {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }
  .hv-flow {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .hv-step {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }
  .hv-step-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--step-small);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .hv-step p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .hv-step small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--step-small);
  }
  .hv-step ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }
  .hv-step li {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .hv-step li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .hv-arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--chart);
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .hv-flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 2rem minmax(0, 1fr) 2rem minmax(0, 1.25fr);
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 0;
    }
    .hv-arrow {
      transform: none;
    }
    .hv-step {
      font-size: var(--step-small);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  }
  .hv-method .actions {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .hv-method .hv-step,
    .hv-method .hv-arrow {
      animation: hv-rise-m 600ms var(--ease-out) both;
    }
    .hv-method .hv-step:nth-of-type(1) { animation-delay: 80ms; }
    .hv-method .hv-flow > :nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 220ms; }
    .hv-method .hv-flow > :nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 300ms; }
    .hv-method .hv-flow > :nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 440ms; }
    .hv-method .hv-flow > :nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 520ms; }
    @keyframes hv-rise-m {
      from { opacity: 0; translate: 0 10px; }
    }
  }
</style>
